            owl:allValuesFrom qudt:SystemOfUnits ;
            owl:onProperty qudt:isUnitOfSystem ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:allValuesFrom xsd:string ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:conversionMultiplier ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:allValuesFrom qudt:SystemOfUnits ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:derivedUnitOfSystem ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:allValuesFrom xsd:string ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:latexDefinition ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:exactMatch ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:udunitsCode ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:allValuesFrom qudt:SystemOfUnits ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:allValuesFrom qudt:SystemOfUnits ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:definedUnitOfSystem ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:allValuesFrom xsd:string ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:iec61360Code ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:symbol ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:allValuesFrom xsd:string ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:symbol ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:iec61360Code ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:allValuesFrom xsd:string ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:uneceCommonCode ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:derivedUnitOfSystem ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:hasQuantityKind ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:uneceCommonCode ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:allValuesFrom xsd:string ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:mathMLdefinition ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty pokemon:derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem ],
        qudt:Concept,
        qudt:Verifiable ;
    skos:definition """
  A unit of measure, or unit, is a particular quantity value that has been chosen as a scale for measuring other quantities the same kind (more generally of equivalent dimension).
  For example, the meter is a quantity of length that has been rigorously defined and standardized by the BIPM (International Board of Weights and Measures).
  Any measurement of the length can be expressed as a number multiplied by the unit meter.
  More formally, the value of a physical quantity Q with respect to a unit (U) is expressed as the scalar multiple of a real number (n) and U, as  $Q = nU$.
  """ ;
    skos:exactMatch qudt:Unit ;
    skos:inScheme <http://qudt.org/subset/qudt_subset> .

